    "| Dataset       | Hists/Cluster | Per-Cluster f32 Array | Passt in L1d? | f16 standalone gewinnt |\n",
    "|---------------|---------------|-----------------------|---------------|------------------------|\n",
    "| dev_small     | ~5 k          | ~20 KB                | Ja            | +40 % (ältere Campaign Daten) |\n",
